      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I do tend to use the tracking data positions much more often than the bone positions. Especially for desktop, where the bone positions are down but the tracking positions are up. Also, not all avatars have humanoid rigs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
